OL,3,AHope for millions as cheaper HIV
OL,4,Aprevention jab reaches Africa
OL,5,
OL,6,FUganda is set to receive its first
OL,7,Fsupplies of a cheaper version of a
OL,8,Fground-breaking injection to prevent
OL,9,FHIV, raising hopes of expanding access
OL,10,Fto the drug across Africa, where the
OL,11,Fburden of the disease remains highest.
OL,13,FThe first global shipment of the
OL,14,Fgeneric drug, known as lenacapavir,
OL,15,Farrived in Zambia on Wednesday, with
OL,16,Fdeliveries to Uganda expected in the
OL,17,Fcoming days, the Global Fund has said.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
