OL,3,AHope for millions as cheaper HIV
OL,4,Aprevention jab reaches Africa
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe drug, administered as an injection
OL,7,Ftwice a year, is nearly 100% effective
OL,8,Fat preventing HIV infection and is
OL,9,Fexpected to cost just $40 (#30) per
OL,10,Fperson annually.
OL,12,FZimbabwe is due to receive supplies
OL,13,Fearly next year, with several other
OL,14,Fcountries expected to follow.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
